---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — CSV Toolbox"
  description="CSV Toolbox privacy policy: your files are processed entirely in your browser and never uploaded. Details on cookies and advertising."
>
  <div class="container guide">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>
      All CSV processing on this site happens <strong>locally in your web browser</strong>. Files you
      select are read by JavaScript running on your device and are <strong>never uploaded,
      transmitted or stored</strong> on our servers or anywhere else. When you close the page, the
      data is gone.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not require accounts and do not collect personal information directly. Our hosting
      provider may collect standard, aggregated technical logs (such as request counts) to operate
      the service.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site is supported by advertising served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may
      use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other
      websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising at
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. See
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how Google uses
      data from sites that use its services</a> for details. We do not set our own tracking cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party resources</h2>
    <p>
      Tool pages load open-source JavaScript libraries (PapaParse, JSZip) from a public CDN. These
      requests are standard static-file fetches and do not include your file data.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy as the site evolves; the date above reflects the latest revision.
      Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
